{"key":"technology/1910s","entities":[{"id":"technology.trolleybus","type":"technology","labels":{"zh-Hans":"无轨电车"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1914","end":"1949","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"上海"},"coord":[121.47,31.23]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1914 年 11 月 15 日，英商上海电车公司开出上海第一条无轨电车线路（今 14 路），南起郑家木桥、北至老闸桥南堍，是上海无轨电车的起点。无轨电车不铺轨道、造价低于有轨电车，1920 年代以后逐渐成为市区公交的补充。"},"category":"交通","tags":["技术","城市日常","交通"],"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.上海无轨电车"}],"adoption":[{"place":"place.port.上海","year":1914,"stage":"introduced","note":{"zh-Hans":"14 路，郑家木桥—老闸桥"}}],"metrics":[{"key":"trolleybus-lines","name":{"zh-Hans":"无轨电车线路"},"unit":"条","points":[{"year":1914,"value":1}]}]}]}